## Joint modelling

We calculated the entire correlation matrix from the posterior median draws of the joint model of mean pupil size and LBA parameters. This correlation matrix can be seen in @fig-tier1-heatmap-supp.








::: {.cell layout-align="center"}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![Correlation matrix of the posterior medians of the group-level correlations between LBA and pupil parameters estimated in the joint model. Blue = positive correlation; red = negative correlation.](supplementary_files/figure-typst/fig-tier1-heatmap-supp-1.png){#fig-tier1-heatmap-supp fig-align='center'}
:::
:::


